<h1><b><center>CHINA</center></b></h1>

<img src="img5.jpg">

<pre>
<font face="times" color="blue">

China, officially the People's Republic of China (PRC), is a
country in East Asia and the world's most populous country.

Covering approximately 9,600,000 square kilometers, it is the
third or fourth largest country by total area. Beijing is its
capital city.

